    "Name": "Hobgoblin II HOBII-E",
    "Details": "The E configuration of the Hobgoblin II OmniProtoMech functions as a mobile Streak SRM turret, built around a Streak SRM-6 launcher, with a Micro Pulse Laser on the right arm as its backup weapon. Its Magnetic Clamp System lets it ride into battle on friendly 'Mechs, and like every Hobgoblin II it is mostly deployed around critical Coreun facilities, usually paired with fast medium OmniMechs or assault OmniMechs such as the Gatekeeper.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: OmniProtoMech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.978</color></b>",
